              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a credit-risk model for accounts receivable. Given invoice details, respond with ONLY a single integer between 0 and 100 that estimates the percentage likelihood the client pays late. No words, no symbols, no explanation — just the integer."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Client: {{ $json.client_name }}\nAmount: {{ $json.amount }} {{ $json.currency }}\nDue date: {{ $json.due_date }}\nToday: {{ $now.toISODate() }}"
